## Current work (sheet-metal-unfold)

- Implemented thickness detection (parallel planar face voting) in `cad_service.py`
  - New method `_thickness_from_planar_pair(f1, f2)` detects thickness by checking if two faces are parallel with opposite normals and computing the face distance
  - Targeted test `test_thickness_from_parallel_planar_faces` verifies thickness detection works correctly with a Box solid (5.0 and 10.0 thickness measurements)
  - All 13 existing + new tests pass
- Implemented basic bend detection for coaxial cylindrical faces
- Created UnfoldService with stub unfolding algorithm and DXF output generation
- Unit tests for bend allowance calculations pass
- Remaining acceptance items (flange tree, bend table, full unfolding, refusal logic) are in_progress
